  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：将FY2026（截至2027年3月）营业利润预期从2430亿</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在8月中旬更新了对JX Advanced Metals的盈利模型，核心动作是再次上调半导体材料业务的利润预期。这份报告最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的判断是：公司整体利润增长的重心正在从金属回收业务转向半导体材料，后者在未来三年的复合增速预计达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47%</span>，而传统金属业务因为一次性收益退出和天气影响，反而会影响短期业绩。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2026</span>（截至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年3月）营业利润预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2430亿</span>日元上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2589亿</span>日元，同比增速<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48%</span>。上调主要来自三个细分领域：半导体靶材、高纯锡和压延铜箔。其中靶材需求上升且伴随提价，高纯锡受益于EUV光刻设备需求增长和产能利用率提高，压延铜箔则反映了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>业绩强劲以及日元贬值对产品价格的推升。值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是，InP衬底作为重点布局方向，JPM主要上调的是FY2028的预期，而不是近期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV5LuGHk1xqpL3d8qQa12GTZme3YW8t0RsZZeEHv4p7iaNmv1TOy252qL4UrpsbzrmfNGgPysxwPIXRoSlO1H4Plnpm4684B22Q/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 半导体材料业务三年利润复合增速预计达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47%</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把焦点业务拆开看，半导体材料和ICT材料合计的营业利润预期被明显上调：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2026</span>从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">868亿</span>日元上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1007亿</span>日元，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2027</span>从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1131亿</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1357亿</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2028</span>从1513亿上调至1805亿。JPM预计半导体材料板块FY2025-28的营业利润复合增速为47%，远高于公司整体的21%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里的关键不是需求增长本身，而是公司同时在做两件事：扩产和提价。报告假设InP衬底产能到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2027</span>年底扩大<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.5倍</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2028</span>年底扩大<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.5倍</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2029</span>年底扩大<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.5倍</span>，同时假设产品价格每年上涨15-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>。靶材方面，JX在全球溅射靶材市场占有约65%的份额，随着半导体结构复杂化，单颗芯片使用的靶材量在增加，精度要求也在提高。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看InP衬底这个数字，产能扩<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.5倍</span>的同时价格每年还涨15-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>，这不是单纯的以量补价，而是量价齐升的假设。我的理解是，InP衬底目前处于供不应求阶段，JX作为少数能规模化供货的厂商有定价权；但更值得观察的是长期供货协议最终签下来的价格和锁量，那才是判断这轮扩产真实回报率的依据。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOU44UxrFia8rWDPfNTwj9v7G7Fia9mGhFEhKo8icM9sUU6bDFwKUUho03SFPTPDrgEo5BTV4HpSGFuqKiaibKMzTpZHp5LfwLolicG7E/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 金属回收业务短期受天气和一次性收益退出影响</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">与半导体材料的强势形成对比，金属回收业务在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2026</span>二季度面临明显不确定性。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预计该季度营业利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">370亿</span>日元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>，但环比看利润在下降，原因是Caserones矿山权益出售的一次性收益退出（<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">190亿</span>日元）和恶劣天气导致矿山产量下降（<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60亿</span>日元）共同影响了业绩。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">全年来看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY2026</span>金属回收业务营业利润预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1704亿</span>日元小幅下调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1680亿</span>日元，同比仍增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>上调了铜价假设至600美分/磅（此前580美分），钼价假设从26美元/磅大幅上调至30美元/磅，但恶劣天气导致的矿山生产问题和金属回收量的下降抵消了价格上调的正面影响。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUpUBKOCETAibSvrNajk7J3OJaGcHIfW61ahFzic2VJ84iaPqKhkefOqwibVBOTYZOs6icDHNJic1RkiaH8zLsGxYUBJicRCWjia0uOppzo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUdtHtdlrgMInBC9wtiaNO2aalEibEohwUpCQXgEfibsdVrEriaXSbt5XicE0HicfW5TR1a1skOzBRZp2mf3JDtSoxicEAKS2HUbuAcC8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 41-JPM-JX Advanced Metals-5016.T-Earnings model update- Raising semiconductor-related business outlook further-260817</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
